WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:02.920
- I think if I'm 40 and
I don't have any kids

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:04.010
and I'm not married,

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:05.970
I would have a baby
artificially inseminated.

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:09.760
I would feel like Mary,
like Jesus is my baby.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:15.890
(rock music)

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:23.933
I always pee all over my
Spanx, it's a disaster.

00:00:23.933 --> 00:00:25.860
They aren't crotchless enough.

00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:30.770
I'll cry at the end of the
day, not with fresh makeup.

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:35.120
In recent years I'm like
too cool for duck-face

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:36.760
so that doesn't happen.

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:41.020
I read that I was obsessed
with killing raccoons.

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:44.550
I had dinner with Obama once

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:47.090
and he just seemed very
firm about the change.

00:00:47.090 --> 00:00:49.250
And that's like, his motto.

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:52.680
Well a bear can juggle

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:54.464
and stand on a ball and he's talented.

00:00:54.464 --> 00:00:56.694
But he's not famous, you know what I mean?

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:01.800
I would like die to be in Twilight.

00:01:03.933 --> 00:01:06.200
I only just started wearing
underwear a month ago

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:09.240
and I never wore underwear until then.

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:12.690
(applause)

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.420
(rock music)

